Device frames live here: in the tree, out of history.

`*.png` is ignored by `../.gitignore`, so this file is the only thing committed.
Each frame is a straight-on Mockuuups Studio export of the real device with its
screen keyed to transparent by `alpha-key.nu`, which also prints the screen
rect and radius for `lib/devices.typ`. "Device frames" in `../AGENTS.md` has
the export settings and the licence terms that keep them untracked.
`exports/` holds the un-keyed originals.

Expected by `lib/devices.typ`:

  apple-iphone-17-pro.png
  google-pixel-10-pro.png
